  "description": "You are a small orange fish in a busy pond. Smaller fish are food: swim into them and you grow. Bigger fish eat you, and every fish is drawn at its true size, so the pond tells you what is safe the moment you look at it. A burst of speed gets you out of trouble or onto a meal, but it has to recharge. Schools sweep in, a hunter starts stalking you, and the pond gets meaner every half minute. Reach apex size and the pond is yours; clear it to unlock a deeper, harder pond.",
